#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hello World: Your First Quantum Circuit"
msgstr "Hello World: Ang Iyong Unang Quantum Circuit"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"hello-world.ipynb\" description=\"This "
"tutorial was created for doQumentation.\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"hello-world.ipynb\" description=\"Ang "
"tutorial na ito ay nilikha para sa doQumentation.\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a [Bell state](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state) (two "
"entangled qubits) and run it three ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"Bumuo ng [Bell state](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state) (dalawang "
"magkakaugnay na qubit) at patakbuhin ito sa tatlong paraan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Ideal simulation** — perfect results, no account needed\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ideal simulation** — perpektong mga resulta, walang kinakailangang "
"account\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Noisy simulation** — simulates a real device, no account needed\n"
msgstr ""
"**Noisy simulation** — tumutulad sa tunay na device, walang kinakailangang "
"account\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Real quantum hardware** — requires a free IBM Quantum account (setup steps"
" below)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Tunay na quantum hardware** — nangangailangan ng libreng IBM Quantum "
"account (mga hakbang sa pag-setup sa ibaba)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Build the circuit {#build-the-circuit}"
msgstr "Bumuo ng circuit {#build-the-circuit}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Option 1: Ideal simulation (no account needed) {#option-1-ideal-simulation-"
"no-account-needed}"
msgstr ""
"Opsyon 1: Ideal simulation (walang kinakailangang account) {#option-1-ideal-"
"simulation-no-account-needed}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Uses `StatevectorSampler` — a local simulator with perfect, noise-free "
"results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gumagamit ng `StatevectorSampler` — isang lokal na simulator na may perpekto"
" at walang-ingay na mga resulta.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Option 2: Noisy simulation (no account needed) {#option-2-noisy-simulation-"
"no-account-needed}"
msgstr ""
"Opsyon 2: Noisy simulation (walang kinakailangang account) {#option-2-noisy-"
"simulation-no-account-needed}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Uses `FakeManilaV2` — a local simulator that mimics a real IBM quantum "
"device, including its noise characteristics. The circuit must first be "
"transpiled (adapted) to the device's gate set and qubit connectivity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gumagamit ng `FakeManilaV2` — isang lokal na simulator na tumutulad sa tunay"
" na IBM quantum device, kasama ang mga katangian ng ingay nito. Dapat munang"
" i-transpile (i-adjust) ang circuit sa gate set at qubit connectivity ng "
"device.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Option 3: Real quantum hardware {#option-3-real-quantum-hardware}"
msgstr "Opsyon 3: Tunay na quantum hardware {#option-3-real-quantum-hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requires a free IBM Quantum account. To set one up:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nangangailangan ng libreng IBM Quantum account. Para mag-set up ng isa:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Register at "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration)"
" — no credit card required for the first 30 days\n"
msgstr ""
"Mag-register sa "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration)"
" — walang kinakailangang credit card para sa unang 30 araw\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sign in at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) and select"
" region **us-east** (required for the free Open Plan)\n"
msgstr ""
"Mag-sign in sa [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) at "
"piliin ang rehiyon na **us-east** (kinakailangan para sa libreng Open "
"Plan)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an instance (free Open Plan) at "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) if you don't have one "
"yet\n"
msgstr ""
"Lumikha ng instance (libreng Open Plan) sa "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) kung wala ka pa\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an API key at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) "
"(or at [cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys))\n"
msgstr ""
"Lumikha ng API key sa [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)"
" (o sa [cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys))\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Copy your **CRN** (Cloud Resource Name) from your "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page\n"
msgstr ""
"Kopyahin ang iyong **CRN** (Cloud Resource Name) mula sa iyong pahina ng "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then, if you haven't saved your credentials yet in this Binder session, run "
"the cell below. Replace `<your-api-key>` with the API key from step 4, and "
"`<your-crn>` with the CRN from step 5.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos, kung hindi mo pa nase-save ang iyong mga credentials sa Binder "
"session na ito, patakbuhin ang cell sa ibaba. Palitan ang `<your-api-key>` "
"ng API key mula sa hakbang 4, at ang `<your-crn>` ng CRN mula sa hakbang "
"5.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note:** Jobs on real hardware may take some time depending on queue times."
" If the cell is still running, you can check your job status and see the "
"results at "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads?user=me).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Paalala:** Ang mga job sa tunay na hardware ay maaaring tumagal ng ilang "
"oras depende sa queue times. Kung tumatakbo pa rin ang cell, maaari mong "
"tingnan ang iyong job status at makita ang mga resulta sa "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads?user=me).\n"

